<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 256-8 V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 256-8 V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe scored 256 for</p>
<p>eight from their 50 overs in the day/night triangular series</p>
<p>match against South Africa at the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
</text>
